    <node id="CRA Publication T4127">
      <data key="d0">CRA Publication T4127</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">CRA Publication T4127 is a publication that contains payroll deductions tables and rates associated with CPP and EI in Canada.</data>
