    <node id="Box 26">
      <data key="d0">Box 26</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Box 26 is mentioned in relation to financial caps and contributes to calculations involving CPP and EI.&lt;SEP&gt;Box 26 is used for reporting additional deductions or earnings on T4 slips.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be3c8254ac3b81df856eab05e2babc4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041dc2e0b32226e0b7c758a7359523f3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772101192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="CPP">
      <data key="d0">CPP</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">CPP refers to Canada Pension Plan contributions which generate non-refundable tax credits.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be3c8254ac3b81df856eab05e2babc4e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772101151</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="EI">
      <data key="d0">EI</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">EI refers to Employment Insurance premiums that also generate non-refundable tax credits.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be3c8254ac3b81df856eab05e2babc4e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772101151</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Federal Tax Rate">
      <data key="d0">Federal Tax Rate</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The federal tax rate is defined as 15%, applied to calculate non-refundable tax credits.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be3c8254ac3b81df856eab05e2babc4e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772101151</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="CPP/EI Credit">
      <data key="d0">CPP/EI Credit</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The CPP/EI credit is calculated based on contributions and premiums, providing a reduction in federal tax payable.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be3c8254ac3b81df856eab05e2babc4e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772101151</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Tax Credits">
      <data key="d0">Tax Credits</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Tax credits reduce the amount of tax payable and can be generated by CPP and EI contributions.&lt;SEP&gt;Tax credits, including BPA, CPP, and EI, reduce the amount of tax payable.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be3c8254ac3b81df856eab05e2babc4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041dc2e0b32226e0b7c758a7359523f3</data>
