      <data key="d2">The Income Tax Act is the legislative framework governing income tax in Canada, including tax brackets and credits.&lt;SEP&gt;The Income Tax Act is the legislation that outlines tax obligations and regulations for individuals and corporations in Canada, including rules for RRSPs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Income Tax Act is a set of laws governing taxation in Canada, providing the framework for tax planning strategies.</data>
