      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ontario Sales Tax Credit helps families with tax relief, allowing up to $345 per adult and per child, subject to income adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;Ontario Sales Tax Credit offers reimbursement for sales tax, adjusted based on family income and number of children.</data>
