      <data key="d0">Guaranteed Income Supplement (GIS)</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4efa231cfe20987fec08d6db7e701fb2</data>
      <data key="d2">Withdrawals from a Tax-Free Savings Account have implications for eligibility for the Guaranteed Income Supplement.</data>
